[00:00.000] 作词 : Maria BC
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Maria BC
[00:16.120]Watched you go with reverence
[00:22.979]Into the heart of it
[00:29.864]Wanna take you by the wrist
[00:36.691]Back to the start again
[00:43.506]
[00:43.527]Life has made you rare and raw
[00:50.367]Anxious for your God's command
[00:55.448]You let the candle burn too long
[01:04.099]Act like there's no time to lose
[01:10.978]
[01:10.999]Drove the steel into the vial
[01:17.836]Into the heart of it
[01:24.683]Drove you home the quarter-mile
[01:31.517]Back to the start again
[01:38.374]
[01:38.395]Left you feeling rare and raw
[01:45.200]Anxious for your God's command
[01:50.352]You let the candle burn till dawn
[01:58.885]Turning burnished bronze to blue
[02:19.456]
[02:19.477]Life has made you rare and raw
[02:26.381]Open to what most evade
[02:31.566]I drink hair of the dog at dawn
[02:40.083]Get ready for work at eight
